  If you use NanoBO, cite this software version and the original research
  methods actually used. See docs/HOW_TO_CITE.md and REFERENCES.bib.
title: "NanoBO: local desktop experiment planning for chemists"
authors:
  - name: "NanoBO contributors"
version: "0.2.4"
date-released: "2026-11-09"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/wei-rui499/NanoBO"
